flowchart TD
 A[Program P and input x] --> B[Hypothetical perfect halting decider H]
 B --> C{Does H predict that P halts?}
 C -->|Yes| D[Construct Q to loop forever]
 C -->|No| E[Construct Q to halt]
 D --> F[Run Q on its own description]
 E --> F
 F --> G[Contradiction: Q does the opposite of H's prediction]
